        "description": "## Create Payment Link\n\nCreate a shareable payment link that customers can use to complete their purchase without integration into your website.\n\n---\n\n## 🔐 Authentication\n\nYou need to enter the authentication token value in the token box, as shown in the image below.\n\n<img src=\"https://theneo-prod-public.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/d6342822-109d-40eb-89d9-f4e62e3aa3ce.jpg\">\n\n---\n\n## 📦 Request Body (Form-Data)\n\n### ✅ Required Parameters\n\n| Parameter | Type | Description | Example |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `amount_cents` | Integer | Payment amount in cents (must be an integer) | `10000` |\n| `payment_methods` | Integer | Your Integration ID | `12345` |\n| `is_live` | Boolean | Status of the Integration ID used (`true` for live, `false` for test) | `false` |\n\n### 🔧 Optional Parameters\n\n| Parameter | Type | Description | Example |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `full_name` | String | Customer's full name | `\"John Doe\"` |\n| `email` | String | Customer's email address | `\"john.doe@email.com\"` |\n| `phone_number` | String | Customer's phone number (international format) | `\"+201234567890\"` |\n| `description` | String | Description about the order/payment | `\"Order payment\"` |\n| `reference_id` | String | Special ID for the merchant (for tracking) | `\"ORD-1001\"` |\n| `notification_url` | String | Your endpoint to receive transaction details | `\"https://merchant.com/callback\"` |\n| `expires_at` | DateTime | Link expiration date (ISO 8601 format) | `\"2023-07-25T18:58:57\"` |\n| `payment_link_image` | String/File | Image URL or file for the product | \\- |\n\n---\n\n### How to Get your Integration IDs:\n\n1. Log in to Paymob Dashboard\n    \n2. Enable **Test Mode** for test IDs or **Live Mode** for live IDs using the toggle at the top of the page\n    \n3. Go to **Developers → Payment Integrations**\n    \n4. Copy the Integration ID\n    \n\n---\n\n<img src=\"https://content.pstmn.io/a280668b-a74e-474f-9d63-0d44fda6dab5/aW1hZ2UucG5n\" width=\"1610\" height=\"634\">\n\n<img src=\"https://content.pstmn.io/9b59b42d-5481-44fd-a192-1e3716dfbab5/aW1hZ2UucG5n\" width=\"1610\" height=\"660\">\n\n---\n\n## 📥 Response\n\n### Success • 201 Created\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"id\": 47116,\n  \"client_info\": {\n    \"full_name\": \"test\",\n    \"email\": \"test@test.com\",\n    \"phone_number\": \"+01234567891\"\n  },\n  \"reference_id\": \"3583783ABZXB\",\n  \"amount_cents\": 1400,\n  \"state\": \"created\",\n  \"description\": null,\n  \"created_at\": \"2024-02-27T15:43:39.110295+04:00\",\n  \"expires_at\": \"2024-07-25T18:58:57+04:00\",\n  \"paid_at\": null,\n  \"client_url\": \"https://accept.paymob.com/flash/?type=new&token=LRR2c214N0NOalpYbkI0Y05wODFueSttUT09X28xcWhLM2FZNGlWdWpiWlp0WUlFeVE9PQ\",\n  \"origin\": 2,\n  \"merchant_staff_tag\": null,\n  \"payment_link_image\": null,\n  \"order\": 193111\n}\n\n ```\n\n### Key Response Fields\n\n| Field | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| `id` | Unique payment link identifier |\n| `shorten_url or client_url` | **The shareable payment link** - share this with your customer |\n| `amount_cents` | Payment amount in cents |\n| `reference_id` | Your merchant reference ID |\n| `created_at` | Link creation timestamp |\n| `expires_at` | Link expiration timestamp |\n\n---\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ Important Notes\n\n- **Test vs Live:** Ensure `is_live` matches your Integration ID mode (test IDs require `false`, live IDs require `true`)\n    \n- **Link Expiration:** Set `expires_at` to prevent old links from being used\n    \n- **Notification URL:** Configure `notification_url` to receive real-time payment status updates\n    \n- **Amount Format:** Amount must be in cents (100.00 EGP = 10000 cents)\n    \n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n| Error | Cause | Solution |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 401 Unauthorized | Invalid or expired token | Regenerate authentication token |\n| 400 Bad Request | Missing required fields | Ensure `amount_cents`, `payment_methods`, and `is_live` are provided |\n| 404 Integration Not Found | Invalid Integration ID | Verify Integration ID from dashboard |\n| Mismatch Error | Test/Live mode mismatch | Match `is_live` with Integration ID mode |"
      },
