        "description": "## Cancel Payment Link\n\nCancel a payment link that customers to stop a created payment link from accepting payments.\n\n---\n\n## 🔐 Authentication\n\nYou need to enter the authentication token value in the token box, as shown in the image below.\n\n<img src=\"https://theneo-prod-public.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/d6342822-109d-40eb-89d9-f4e62e3aa3ce.jpg\">\n\n---\n\n## 📦 Request Body (Form-Data)\n\n## ✅ Required Parameters\n\n| Parameter | Type | Description | Example |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `payment_link_id` | Integer | The ID of the Payment Link you need to cancel. This ID will be provided in the response of the Payment Link request, or you can get it from the dashboard | `10000` |\n\n### How to Get the Payment Lik ID from the dashboard:\n\n1. Log in to Paymob Dashboard\n    \n2. Enable **Test Mode** for test IDs or **Live Mode** for live IDs using the toggle at the top of the page\n    \n3. Go to **Payment Links→ Quick Link**\n    \n4. Copy the Quick Link ID\n    \n\n<img src=\"https://content.pstmn.io/d7144946-54e3-49c8-9d88-7d1c64e58de9/aW1hZ2UucG5n\" alt=\"\" height=\"620\" width=\"1434\"><img src=\"https://content.pstmn.io/4477c113-4d60-4048-91df-1ee8927bc3d5/aW1hZ2UucG5n\" alt=\"\" height=\"625\" width=\"1434\">"
